WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 90s v1.0 — ai-reads-human (ha) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.255
<v Narrator>@ action: inmenu

2
00:00:01.335 --> 00:00:11.733
<v Narrator>Na uku, yankan rubutun da aka gina zuwa ga AI kalmomin ɓangaren ya kashe sau biyu fiye da ƙarfin lantarki fiye da parsing the text itself.

3
00:00:11.813 --> 00:00:35.272
<v Narrator>An tsara siffofin da ke cika da kwasfa, komai, da kuma sararin da aka rufe don mutane su iya bincika fayiloli cikin sauƙi a cikin masu gyara rubutu. Amma kayan aikin AI na yau da kullun suna wucewa miliyan daga waɗannan bayanan rubutun da suka fi magana daga injin zuwa injin ba tare da mutum ya taba kallo ba.

4
00:00:35.352 --> 00:00:58.735
<v Narrator>Mun kira wannan aikin ƙari na harajin impedance kuma mun gwada parsing da kalmomin-shigar da aka yi aiki a kan rikodin dubu ashirin. Running kowane wucewa cikin wani tsari mai aiki na musamman akan mai sarrafa Apple ya raba farashin parsing mai ƙarancin girma daga ayyukan kwamfutar tafi-da-gidanka masu zafi.

5
00:00:58.815 --> 00:00:59.191
<v Narrator>@ info

6
00:00:59.271 --> 00:01:17.490
<v Narrator>Har ma da ƙara wurare biyu na indent mai kyau fiye da raguwa AI kalma-shakatawa makamashi zuwa microjoules arba'in da daya ga kowane rajista. Ka riƙe cikin injin pipes compact da binary, da kuma format rubutu kawai lokacin da mutane karanta.
